 control are both marked in the modifiers bitmask even though a press event was never received for the left control press.\r\n\r\n```\r\nLibrary initialized\r\nCreating windowed mode window 1 (640x480)\r\nMain loop starting\r\n00000000 to 1 at 0.234: Window position: 1600 858\r\n00000001 to 1 at 0.234: Window refresh\r\n00000002 to 1 at 0.235: Window focused\r\n00000003 to 1 at 0.963: Key 0x0154 Scancode 0x0032 (LEFT SHIFT) (with no mods) was pressed\r\n00000004 to 1 at 2.746: Key 0x004a Scancode 0x002c (J) (j) (with shift control) was pressed\r\n00000005 to 1 at 2.866: Key 0x004a Scancode 0x002c (J) (j) (with shift control) was released\r\n00000006 to 1 at 3.659: Key 0x0154 Scancode 0x0032 (LEFT SHIFT) (with shift control) was released\r\n0000000c to 1 at 5.363: Key 0x0156 Scancode 0x0040 (LEFT ALT) (with no mods) was pressed\r\n0000000d to 1 at 5.497: Window close\r\n```\r\n\r\nSee also 4ff66a7818e3eaa5362c828a18220b12f1cd9bc8, #747, and #964.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glfw/glfw/issues/1415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glfw/glfw/issues/1415/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":14924072871,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAJFXBc4MqcAHzwAAAAN5i0en","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glfw/glfw/issues/events/14924072871","actor":{"login":"yuliufr","id":6957181,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTcxODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6957181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuliufr","html_url":"https://github.com/yuliufr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuliufr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuliufr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuliufr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuliufr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap